<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>配置管理</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../layui/css/layui.css">
    <link href="../bootstrap-5.3.0-alpha1-dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --sky-050: #f2fbff;
            --sky-100: #e7f6ff;
            --sky-200: #d1ebff;
            --sky-400: #65bdf8;
            --sky-500: #2594ea;
            --sky-600: #1d79cb;
            --ink-900: #123044;
            --ink-700: #395367;
            --ink-500: #6a8295;
            --line: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.14);
            --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
            --shadow: 0 22px 48px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
            --shadow-soft: 0 10px 24px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.08);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-family: "Avenir Next", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(101, 189, 248, 0.24), transparent 30%),
                radial-gradient(circle at right 15%, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.14), transparent 25%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #f5fcff 0%, #f1f8fd 55%, #edf5fb 100%);
        }

        body::before {
            content: "";
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
            mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24), transparent 84%);
        }

        .topbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 20;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            background: rgba(247, 252, 255, 0.82);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.05);
        }

        .page-shell {
            max-width: 1360px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
        }

        .topbar-inner {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 18px;
            min-height: 78px;
        }

        .brand-wrap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7bd3ff 0%, #2594ea 100%);
            color: #fff;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.22);
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            margin-top: 2px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-link-flat {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 42px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.18s ease;
        }

        .nav-link-flat:hover,
        .nav-link-flat.is-active {
            color: var(--sky-600);
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
        }

        .page {
            padding: 26px 24px 34px;
        }

        .hero {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(280px, 0.9fr);
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 28px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.97) 0%, rgba(240, 250, 255, 0.96) 52%, rgba(222, 242, 255, 0.96) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .hero::before,
        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 999px;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero::before {
            width: 380px;
            height: 380px;
            right: -120px;
            top: -180px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(101, 189, 248, 0.32), transparent 70%);
        }

        .hero::after {
            width: 260px;
            height: 260px;
            right: 80px;
            bottom: -150px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.18), transparent 72%);
        }

        .hero-copy,
        .hero-side {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .hero-kicker {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 34px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.11);
            color: var(--sky-600);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero-title {
            margin: 18px 0 10px;
            font-size: clamp(28px, 4.6vw, 40px);
            line-height: 1.12;
            letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        }

        .hero-subtitle {
            margin: 0;
            max-width: 780px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .hero-tip-grid {
            display: grid;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .hero-tip {
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 22px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .hero-tip-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ink-500);
        }

        .hero-tip-value {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .hero-tip-text {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: var(--ink-700);
        }

        .groups {
            display: grid;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .group-card {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            padding: 22px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            background: var(--panel);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
        }

        .group-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0 auto auto 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.28), transparent);
        }

        .group-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .group-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }

        .group-subtitle {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .group-chip {
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            color: var(--sky-600);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .group-fields {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .group-fields.single {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .field-card {
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.99), rgba(244, 251, 255, 0.95));
        }

        .field-card.wide {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .field-card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .field-name {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .field-key {
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .field-desc {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .field-value {
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .field-value .form-control,
        .corpus-toolbar .form-control,
        .corpus-textarea,
        .modal-textarea {
            min-height: 46px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.14);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
            color: var(--ink-900);
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
        }

        .field-value textarea.form-control,
        .corpus-textarea,
        .modal-textarea {
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .field-value .form-control[readonly] {
            cursor: default;
        }

        .field-btn,
        .flat-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 40px;
            padding: 0 16px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            color: var(--ink-900);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, background 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.08);
        }

        .field-btn:hover,
        .flat-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-1px);
            background: #ffffff;
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.22);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(21, 82, 130, 0.1);
            color: var(--ink-900);
        }

        .flat-btn-primary,
        .field-btn {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #37a7f8 0%, #1e7fd2 100%);
            border-color: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.26);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 26px rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.2);
        }

        .field-btn:hover,
        .flat-btn-primary:hover {
            color: #fff;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c9af0 0%, #166eb9 100%);
        }

        .flat-btn-danger {
            color: #a5344d;
            background: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.1);
            border-color: rgba(209, 77, 104, 0.14);
        }

        .flat-btn-danger:hover {
            color: #8a2a40;
        }

        .field-footnote {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .corpus-toolbar {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 140px 140px;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }

        .corpus-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }

        .corpus-card {
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.99), rgba(244, 251, 255, 0.95));
        }

        .corpus-card-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .corpus-card-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .corpus-card-key {
            margin-top: 6px;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .corpus-count {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 30px;
            padding: 0 12px;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
            color: var(--sky-600);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .corpus-card-desc {
            margin-top: 10px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .corpus-textarea {
            min-height: 220px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .corpus-actions {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }

        .corpus-hint {
            color: var(--ink-500);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .corpus-empty {
            padding: 28px 18px;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--ink-500);
            line-height: 1.8;
            border-radius: 18px;
            border: 1px dashed rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.18);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        }

        .modal {
            display: none;
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(14, 30, 42, 0.42);
            padding: 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .modal.is-open {
            display: block;
        }

        .modal-card {
            width: min(860px, 100%);
            margin: 7vh auto 0;
            border-radius: 24px;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.12);
            box-shadow: 0 28px 70px rgba(14, 30, 42, 0.22);
        }

        .modal-header,
        .modal-footer {
            padding: 18px 22px;
        }

        .modal-header {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .modal-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.1);
        }

        .modal-body {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .modal-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .modal-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .modal-subtitle {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75;
        }

        .modal-textarea {
            min-height: 220px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        .modal-close {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: rgba(37, 148, 234, 0.08);
            color: var(--ink-700);
            font-size: 24px;
            line-height: 1;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1120px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .group-fields,
            .corpus-grid,
            .corpus-toolbar {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .topbar-inner {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 680px) {
            .page-shell,
            .page {
                padding-left: 14px;
                padding-right: 14px;
            }

            .hero,
            .group-card {
                border-radius: 22px;
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            .nav-links,
            .field-btn,
            .flat-btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="page-shell topbar-inner">
            <div class="brand-wrap">
                <div class="brand-mark">AI</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-title">智能假人控制台</div>
                    <div class="brand-subtitle">运行时配置与世界互动参数管理</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/home" class="nav-link-flat">首页</a>
                <a href="/config" class="nav-link-flat is-active">配置页</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page page-shell">
        <section class="hero">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <div class="hero-kicker">Runtime Config</div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">把常用配置拆成更清晰的工作区，而不是挤在一条长表单里</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">
                    这里修改的是运行时配置，保存后会直接写入 <code>config/config.json</code>。
                    页面按账号基础、成品准备、世界互动三组分开，适合日常维护密码、邮件标题、组队词和喊话词。
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-side">
                <div class="hero-tip-grid">
                    <div class="hero-tip">
                        <div class="hero-tip-label">配置分组</div>
                        <div class="hero-tip-value">3</div>
                        <div class="hero-tip-text">账号基础、成品准备、世界互动三组，常用项更容易定位。</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-tip">
                        <div class="hero-tip-label">特别提醒</div>
                        <div class="hero-tip-text">
                            <code>world_chat</code> 现在会作为“自定义补充词库”叠加到本地语料文件
                            <code>data/chat_corpus.json</code> 上一起参与自动喊话。
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <div id="configGroups" class="groups"></div>

        <section class="group-card" style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <div class="group-head">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="group-title">本地语料库</h2>
                    <div id="chatCorpusSubtitle" class="group-subtitle">这里可以直接维护 data/chat_corpus.json。每行一句，保存后会立刻参与自动喊话。</div>
                </div>
                <div id="chatCorpusSummaryChip" class="group-chip">加载中</div>
            </div>

            <div class="corpus-toolbar">
                <input id="newCorpusCategoryInput" class="form-control" placeholder="新分类 key，例如 daily_chat / trade / pk">
                <button id="createCorpusCategoryBtn" class="flat-btn flat-btn-primary" type="button">新建分类</button>
                <button id="reloadCorpusBtn" class="flat-btn" type="button">刷新语料</button>
            </div>

            <div class="field-footnote">推荐 key 使用英文小写、数字、下划线或中横线。现有任务类型可直接复用：global、team、xiangyao、zhuxian、shimen、bangpai、chubao。</div>

            <div id="chatCorpusManager" class="corpus-grid">
                <div class="corpus-empty">正在加载本地语料库...</div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <div id="editModal" class="modal">
        <div class="modal-card">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div class="modal-top">
                    <div>
                        <h2 id="modalTitle" class="modal-title">编辑配置</h2>
                        <div id="modalSubtitle" class="modal-subtitle">保存后会立即写入配置文件。</div>
                    </div>
                    <button id="modalCloseBtn" class="modal-close" type="button">&times;</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <textarea id="modalTextarea" class="form-control modal-textarea"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button id="modalCancelBtn" class="flat-btn" type="button">取消</button>
                <button id="modalSubmitBtn" class="flat-btn flat-btn-primary" type="button">保存</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="../jquery-3.6.0/jquery-3.6.0.min.js"></script>
    <script src="../layui/layui.js"></script>
    <script src="../bootstrap-5.3.0-alpha1-dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/js/configView.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
